('home','home.hero.cta2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Contact Our Team','/contact',1,2),
('home','home.intro','A Trusted Supply Partner in Sri Lanka',
 'GTC Holdings Int (Pvt) Ltd is an import, wholesale and retail company serving customers across Sri Lanka.',
 'We supply solar lighting and renewable energy products, electrical and power equipment, automotive accessories and general merchandise. We serve households, businesses, retailers, resellers and contractors, and we support customers who need help sourcing products from China.\n\nOur aim is straightforward: dependable products, competitive pricing and service that keeps customers coming back.',
 'uploads/seed/intro.webp','More About Us','/about',1,3),
('home','home.categories','Explore Our Product Range',
 'A focused range of imported products for homes, businesses and resellers.','','','','',1,4),
('home','home.featured','Featured Products',
 'A selection from our current catalogue. Contact us for availability, specifications and pricing.','','','','',1,5),
('home','home.solar','Smart Solar Lighting for Every Space',
 'Solar lighting is a practical option for homes, gardens, roads, warehouses and commercial premises, and for locations where grid electricity is not convenient.',
 'Solar lighting can be used for pathways, boundaries, compounds and outdoor areas without relying on mains wiring. GTC Holdings supplies solar lighting products for both retail and wholesale buyers, and we are happy to discuss which option suits your requirement.\n\nContact us to discuss the solar lighting products currently available.',
 'uploads/seed/solar-section.webp','View Solar Lighting','/solar-lighting',1,6),
('home','home.why','Why Choose GTC Holdings',
 'The reasons customers choose to work with us.','','','','',1,7),
('home','home.why.1','Competitive Pricing','','We work to keep our pricing competitive for both retail and wholesale customers.','','','',1,8),
('home','home.why.2','Retail & Wholesale Supply','','We serve individual buyers as well as retailers, resellers and contractors who need regular supply.','','','',1,9),
('home','home.why.3','Wide Product Selection','','Solar lighting, electrical products, automotive accessories and general merchandise under one supplier.','','','',1,10),
('home','home.why.4','Islandwide Delivery','','We arrange delivery of orders to customers across Sri Lanka.','','','',1,11),
('home','home.why.5','Customer Service','','Our team is available by telephone, email and WhatsApp to answer product and supply questions.','','','',1,12),
('home','home.why.6','China Sourcing & Import Support','','We assist businesses with product sourcing, supplier coordination and cargo arrangements from China.','','','',1,13),
('home','home.import','Import from China with Confidence',
 'From product sourcing to shipping coordination, GTC Holdings helps Sri Lankan businesses navigate their China import requirements.',
 'We assist with product sourcing, supplier coordination, wholesale purchasing and cargo arrangements for customers importing from China. We work with sourcing centres such as Guangzhou and Yiwu and help coordinate the movement of goods to Sri Lanka.',
 'uploads/seed/import-section.webp','Discuss Your Import Requirements','/china-import',1,14),
('home','home.wholesale','Retail and Wholesale Supply',
 'We support individuals, retailers, resellers, contractors and commercial buyers.',
 'Whether you are buying a single item or placing a regular wholesale order, our team can help you find the right products. If you are a retailer or reseller, contact us to discuss ongoing supply and pricing.',
 'uploads/seed/wholesale.webp','Enquire About Wholesale Supply','/contact',1,15),
('home','home.cta','Looking for the Right Products or Import Solution?',
 'Speak to our team about product availability, wholesale supply or your China import requirements.',
 NULL,NULL,'Contact Us','/contact',1,16),

