('solar-lighting','solar.intro','Reliable Solar Lighting Supply',
 'We supply a range of solar lighting products for retail and wholesale customers.','Solar lighting uses energy from the sun and does not depend on mains wiring, which makes it suitable for outdoor areas, remote locations and premises where a permanent power supply is difficult to arrange. Our range covers street, flood, garden and wall lighting, along with portable solar power products.\n\nContact our team to discuss the models and quantities currently available.','uploads/seed/solar-section.webp',NULL,NULL,1,2),
('solar-lighting','solar.benefits','Benefits of Solar Lighting',
 'Why solar lighting is worth considering.','','uploads/seed/prod-solar-panel.webp','','',1,3),
('solar-lighting','solar.benefit.1','Independent of mains power','','Solar lighting does not rely on mains wiring, so it can be used in locations without a convenient electricity supply.','','','',1,4),
('solar-lighting','solar.benefit.2','Suitable for outdoor areas','','A practical option for gardens, compounds, pathways and boundary areas.','','','',1,5),
('solar-lighting','solar.benefit.3','Low running cost','','Solar lighting uses energy from the sun, which can reduce reliance on grid electricity.','','','',1,6),
('solar-lighting','solar.benefit.4','Simple to install','','Solar lighting is generally straightforward to position without extensive wiring work.','','','',1,7),
('solar-lighting','solar.benefit.5','Useful during power failures','','Solar lighting can provide illumination when mains power is unavailable.','','','',1,8),
('solar-lighting','solar.applications','Common Applications',
 'Where our solar lighting products are commonly used.','','','','',1,9),
('solar-lighting','solar.application.1','Homes','','For gardens, entrances and outdoor areas.','','','',1,10),
('solar-lighting','solar.application.2','Gardens','','For pathways, landscaping and decoration.','','','',1,11),
('solar-lighting','solar.application.3','Roads','','For roads and internal access routes.','','','',1,12),
('solar-lighting','solar.application.4','Warehouses','','For yards, loading areas and compounds.','','','',1,13),
('solar-lighting','solar.application.5','Commercial premises','','For car parks, boundaries and business premises.','','','',1,14),
('solar-lighting','solar.application.6','Outdoor areas','','For camps, farms and open outdoor spaces.','','','',1,15),
('solar-lighting','solar.application.7','Off-grid locations','','For sites without a convenient grid connection.','','','',1,16),
('solar-lighting','solar.cta','Discuss Your Solar Lighting Requirement',
