('china-import','import.intro','Practical Import Support',
 'We help Sri Lankan businesses manage the practical steps of importing from China.','Sourcing products from overseas involves several steps, from identifying suppliers to arranging shipping. GTC Holdings helps customers work through these steps and coordinates the arrangements on their behalf. We work with major trading centres in China, including Guangzhou and Yiwu.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,2),
('china-import','import.services','Our Import Services',
 'The assistance we provide to importing customers.','','','','',1,3),
('china-import','import.service.1','Product sourcing assistance','','Help identifying products and suppliers that match your requirement.','','','',1,4),
('china-import','import.service.2','Supplier coordination','','Assistance communicating with suppliers and confirming requirements.','','','',1,5),
('china-import','import.service.3','Wholesale purchasing support','','Support with placing and managing wholesale purchase orders.','','','',1,6),
('china-import','import.service.4','Import order coordination','','Coordination of the order from confirmation through to dispatch.','','','',1,7),
('china-import','import.service.5','Air cargo arrangements','','Assistance arranging air cargo for suitable consignments.','','','',1,8),
('china-import','import.service.6','Sea cargo arrangements','','Assistance arranging sea cargo for larger consignments.','','','',1,9),
('china-import','import.service.7','Warehouse coordination in China','','Coordination with warehouses and consolidation points in China.','','','',1,10),
('china-import','import.service.8','Shipping and logistics coordination','','Coordination of shipping and logistics arrangements for your goods.','','','',1,11),
('china-import','import.service.9','Shipment updates and coordination','','Updates on shipment progress through the agreed communication channels.','','','',1,12),
('china-import','import.locations','Where We Source',
 'We work with suppliers in major Chinese trading centres.','Our sourcing activity covers established trading centres in China, including Guangzhou and Yiwu. These centres offer a wide range of consumer goods, electrical products and general merchandise. Let us know what you are looking for and we will help you identify suitable supply options.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,13),
